vsinpu: accept initializers ort keeps in memory

ort moves large initializers into memory and tags them as external data, so
GetCapability rejected every real model and everything silently ran on the cpu.
Only refuse data in an external file, and unpack weights with the
location-aware UnpackTensor overload instead of reading raw_data directly.

Upstream-Status: Pending

